  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28517001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28517002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是想問這個是什麼嗎？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28517003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "這是專門為迪卡準備的……家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28517004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "迪卡你承擔了所有和怪獸戰鬥的責任，一定忍受了不少辛苦和孤獨。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28517005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我們的世界沒有怪獸那種東西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28517006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所以就不需要迪卡你以特殊的身分繼續承擔那些了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28517007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "在這個世界你可以以普通人的身分享受生活。啊，抱歉，應該說作為一個普通模型享受生活。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28517008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "總之，為了感謝迪卡守護了我們的夢想。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28517009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "今後就由我來守護你吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28517010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
